   "text": "Curtin Singapore - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nCurtin Singapore\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nCurtin University is a global university with campuses in Australia, Malaysia, Singapore, Dubai and Mauritius. The Singapore campus is located in the heart of Singapore city, and offers a comprehensive and safe study environment. Curtin Singapore offers a starting point, delivering a range of pathway diploma, undergraduate, postgraduate, study abroad and English language courses.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 05:51\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 07:24\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nSingapore\nYearly Fees\nMax: SGD 29,198.00\nMin: SGD 16,988.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n10%\n140 of 1,400 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n2008\nCampus(es)\nSingapore\nCountry\nSingapore\nExcluded Countries\nAustralia, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, United States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9YFq-314oPk\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
